example:
```sql
-- WRONG: This will return exactly 0 rows, always.
SELECT * FROM Employees WHERE PhoneNumber = NULL;

-- CORRECT: You must use the IS NULL operator.
SELECT * FROM Employees WHERE PhoneNumber IS NULL;

-- CORRECT: Handling NULLs in calculations using COALESCE
SELECT Name, Salary + COALESCE(Bonus, 0) as TotalCompensation 
FROM Employees;
```

